<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on Swiss Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued 12 million American-style call warrants on registered shares of Swiss Reinsurance Co, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Cp Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 100 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,000 CHF		 PREMIUM	14.44 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.05 CHF		  GEARING	18.34 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.JUN.97-15.MAY.98   PAYDATE	03.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,830 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
